config SILICONFOREST_M3
	bool "SiliconForest M3 retained-firmware stack (development only)"
	depends on ARM64 && ARCH_APPLE && EXPERT
	depends on !USB4
	help
	  Build the separately imported PR358/PR363 GPU, display, PHY and PMP
	  stack instead of the maintained implementations. Default N. This
	  is a source integration for J514S and J516C development, not a
	  hardware-qualified release. Requires matching boot-loader handoffs
	  and Mesa; J516C also needs its measured board-data firmware file.

	  USB4 is excluded because the imported display stack predates the
	  maintained tunnel ownership API. USB-C DP alternate mode is separate.
	  Use the DTBs under apple/m3-g15/, not the maintained board DTBs.
	  The retained coprocessor sessions have no safe unload/restart path.
	  Say N for a normal SiliconForest kernel.
